---
// Two-phase locking in two small pictures: who waits for whom (S/X), and when locks are taken and released.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const cells = [
  { x: 150, y: 128, ok: true, en: 'run together', vi: 'chạy chung' },
  { x: 282, y: 128, ok: false, en: 'must wait', vi: 'phải chờ' },
  { x: 150, y: 200, ok: false, en: 'must wait', vi: 'phải chờ' },
  { x: 282, y: 200, ok: false, en: 'must wait', vi: 'phải chờ' },
];
---
<figure class="txlp">
  <div class="txlp-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 330" role="img" aria-label="Left, a lock compatibility table: a shared lock held and a shared lock wanted run together; every other pairing among shared and exclusive locks must wait. Right, a graph of locks held over time: the count only grows while the transaction runs, then drops to zero all at once at commit or abort.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Two-phase locking: who waits, and for how long</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Two-phase locking: ai phải chờ, và chờ bao lâu</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="20" y="44" width="390" height="270" rx="6" class="txlp-panel" />
    <DiagramIcon name="lock" x={44} y={68} size={22} />
    <text x="66" y="73" class="sec"><tspan data-lang-en>Who has to wait?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ai phải chờ?</tspan></text>
    <text x="211" y="96" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>S held</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đang giữ S</tspan></text>
    <text x="343" y="96" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>X held</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đang giữ X</tspan></text>
    <text x="211" y="116" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>read lock</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>khoá đọc</tspan></text>
    <text x="343" y="116" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>write lock</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>khoá ghi</tspan></text>
    <text x="36" y="164" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Wants S</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Muốn S</tspan></text>
    <text x="36" y="236" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Wants X</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Muốn X</tspan></text>
    {cells.map((c) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={c.x} y={c.y} width="122" height="56" rx="4" class={`txlp-box ${c.ok ? 'is-ok' : ''}`} />
        <text x={c.x + 61} y={c.y + 33} class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>{c.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{c.vi}</tspan></text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="36" y="296" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>Only two readers can share. Any write waits for everyone.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ hai người đọc mới dùng chung được. Mọi lệnh ghi đều phải chờ.</tspan></text>

    <rect x="430" y="44" width="450" height="270" rx="6" class="txlp-panel is-ok" />
    <text x="446" y="73" class="sec"><tspan data-lang-en>Locks held by one transaction</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khoá một transaction đang giữ</tspan></text>
    <line x1="470" y1="262" x2="860" y2="262" class="txlp-arrow" />
    <line x1="470" y1="262" x2="470" y2="94" class="txlp-arrow" />
    <text x="478" y="102" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>locks held</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>số khoá đang giữ</tspan></text>
    <text x="858" y="256" class="note" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>time</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thời gian</tspan></text>
    <path d="M470,262 L500,262 L500,226 L550,226 L550,190 L600,190 L600,154 L650,154 L650,122 L700,122 L700,262" class="txlp-arrow is-ok" style="stroke-width: 2.4" />
    <text x="580" y="284" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Growing: acquire, never release</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tăng: chỉ xin, không nhả</tspan></text>
    <text x="780" y="170" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>All released</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhả hết</tspan></text>
    <text x="780" y="188" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>at commit or abort</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lúc commit hoặc abort</tspan></text>
    <path d="M706,200 L706,250" class="txlp-arrow is-ok" /><polygon points="706,258 702,250 710,250" class="txlp-head is-ok" />
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Left: shared (S) locks let many readers in, but an exclusive (X) lock makes everyone else wait. Right: a transaction takes locks as it goes and keeps every one until the end. That is why one slow scan can freeze writers, and why deadlocks happen.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Trái: khoá shared (S) cho nhiều người đọc cùng vào, còn khoá exclusive (X) bắt mọi người khác chờ. Phải: transaction xin khoá dần dần và giữ tất cả đến cuối. Vì thế một lần quét chậm có thể đóng băng các lệnh ghi, và deadlock mới xảy ra.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .txlp { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .txlp-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .txlp svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .txlp text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .txlp .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txlp .sec { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txlp .sec.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .txlp .b { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txlp .m { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .txlp .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12px; }
  .txlp .note { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txlp .note.is-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 600; }
  .txlp .note.is-ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 600; }
  .txlp .num { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txlp-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txlp-panel.is-bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .txlp-panel.is-ok { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .txlp-box { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txlp-box.is-bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txlp-box.is-ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txlp-dot { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txlp-arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .txlp-arrow.is-bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .txlp-arrow.is-ok { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .txlp-dash { stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .txlp-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txlp-head.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .txlp-head.is-ok { fill: var(--gold); }
  .txlp-life { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .txlp figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5; }
</style>
